==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|sh}} {{term|tragoedia|lang=la}}, from the {{etyl|grc|sh}} {{term|sc=polytonic|τραγῳδία||tr=tragōidia|epic play, tragedy|lang=grc}}, from {{term|sc=polytonic|τράγος|tr=tragos||male goat|lang=grc}} + {{term|ᾠδή||song|tr=ōidē|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}}, a reference to the goat-satyrs of the theatrical plays of the [[Dorians]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/trǎɡeːdija/|lang=sh}}
